#: patterns/page-don.php:25
msgid "Say what a donation changes, in a few words."
msgstr "Ce que change un don, en quelques mots."

#: patterns/page-don.php:29
msgid "Name the cause and the people it serves. One or two sentences are enough."
msgstr "Nommer la cause et les personnes qu’elle aide. Une ou deux phrases suffisent."

