#: src/Admin/Transfer.php:523
msgid "The export is a JSON file with the settings of the suite: modules on or off, palette, fonts, forms, security, plus the page templates saved from the editor. Import it on another site to replay the same configuration. It holds no other content, no media and no key, and it is not a backup of the site: that job belongs to the host."
